{
  "slug": "planetscale",
  "name": "Planetscale",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An authenticated hosted MCP server that accesses your PlanetScale organizations, databases, branches, schema, and Insights data. Query against your data, surface slow queries, and get organizational and account information.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `mysql` (Plan and review MySQL/InnoDB schema, indexing, query tuning, transactions, and operations), `neki` (Overview and information about Neki, the sharded Postgres product by PlanetScale), `postgres` (PostgreSQL best practices, query optimization, connection troubleshooting, and performance improvement), `vitess` (Vitess best practices, query optimization, and connection troubleshooting for PlanetScale Vitess databases), `00-safe-orchestrator` (Master skill that runs the full PlanetScale safe best-practices assessment — inventory, engine review, Insights, Traffic Control, webhooks,…), `01-readonly-inventory` (Collect read-only evidence about PlanetScale org, database, branches, webhooks, backups, roles, Insights, recommendations, and traffic configuration), `02-vitess-safety-review` (Review a PlanetScale Vitess database for safe migrations, deploy requests, schema recommendations, Insights, webhooks, and operational safety), `03-postgres-safety-review` (Review PlanetScale Postgres for Traffic Control, query tags, roles, pg_strict, backups/PITR, private connectivity, webhooks, branches, and safe agent…), and 11 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `planetscale`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install planetscale@claude-plugins-official` from `planetscale/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
